@@ -0,0 +1,9 @@
+# VisionSen Factory PC Tool v0.6.2 – Production Final
+
+- Production release guard strengthened.
+- External Full-Flash ZIP is accepted only when every flash component SHA-256 exactly matches the embedded approved OIM3 2.2.0 final build.
+- External App-Only BIN is accepted only when its SHA-256 exactly matches the approved embedded `visionsen_oim3.bin`.
+- Same-version stale/pre-final firmware packages are rejected even when their own manifest is internally self-consistent.
+- Embedded firmware metadata restored to the complete ESP32 production manifest (`target=esp32`, IDF v6.1, VS2/protocol 4, factory identity schema 2, manifest schema 1, nonce counter-v1).
+- Protected regions remain: factory_data `0x12000..0x17fff`, nonce_state `0x18000..0x1ffff`, storage `0x320000..0x3fffff`.
